DISCLAIMER — DATA SANITIZATION SOFTWARE

This software is provided for research, education, and legitimate professional
use in digital forensics and data sanitization.

THE AUTHORS MAKE NO WARRANTY THAT THIS SOFTWARE WILL COMPLETELY PREVENT DATA
RECOVERY FROM ANY STORAGE MEDIUM.  Effectiveness depends on the storage
technology, device firmware, operating system, and sanitization method used.

PHYSICAL NAND ERASURE: Logical block overwrite does NOT guarantee physical
NAND cell erasure on SSDs, USB flash drives, or SD/memory cards due to wear
levelling, over-provisioning, and Flash Translation Layer (FTL) remapping.
Refer to NIST SP 800-88 Rev. 1 for media-specific sanitization guidance.

USE AT YOUR OWN RISK.  The authors accept no liability for data loss, legal
consequences, or damage arising from use of this software.
